(5471775, 788222, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition.  I like the placement of the cross on this line of third.  The negative space works really well for this image.  The black and white is perfect for this shot.  A great submission</td>', 'Nice, simple composition.  I like the placement of the cross on this line of third.  The negative space works really well for this image.  The black and white is perfect for this shot.  A great submission', '2009-05-06 03:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471784, 788520, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the topic.  An attempt to portray the underworld and the fears of many people, especially those that are afraid of the dark.  I like how the subject the green in a black and white scene.  The noise int he sky and the light replections in the picture are a problem.  the light refelctions could have easily been fixed as this is advanced editing.  The lack of detail int he subject make me both curious and wanting more.  What is it and what is it doing?????</td>', 'Interesting take on the topic.  An attempt to portray the underworld and the fears of many people, especially those that are afraid of the dark.  I like how the subject the green in a black and white scene.  The noise int he sky and the light replections in the picture are a problem.  the light refelctions could have easily been fixed as this is advanced editing.  The lack of detail int he subject make me both curious and wanting more.  What is it and what is it doing?????', '2009-05-06 03:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471788, 787944, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different image and not what I was expecting from this challenge.  It appears that the swimmer is in broad sunlight, which makes the darkness in the top of the image seem out of place.  I like the idea, but feel that the overall result does not have the overall impact that it could have.</td>', 'A different image and not what I was expecting from this challenge.  It appears that the swimmer is in broad sunlight, which makes the darkness in the top of the image seem out of place.  I like the idea, but feel that the overall result does not have the overall impact that it could have.', '2009-05-06 03:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471792, 788765, 96881, '<td valign="top">That you did.......<br/>Something I expected to see a couple of times int his challenge, but one that does, in the end, has very little asthetically pleasing for it.  The colouor elements int he image are undefinable, the internal camera reflection is the most interesting and draws attenton, but is not large enough or have enough detail to hold the entire picture together</td>', 'That you did.......Something I expected to see a couple of times int his challenge, but one that does, in the end, has very little asthetically pleasing for it.  The colouor elements int he image are undefinable, the internal camera reflection is the most interesting and draws attenton, but is not large enough or have enough detail to hold the entire picture together', '2009-05-06 03:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471797, 788068, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great capture and great processing of this image.  it meets the challenge in some way and has plently of interesting elements in it.  The title helps connect to the challenge, and this was not what I expected to see in here, but it works.  The lighting is well done, especially when you consider the depth in the image that needed to be correctly lit.  The bubbles, they provide interest, and cut up the plain black background, but the Physics nerd in me does ask ''Where do they come from'' in a scene sense (not in the blow bubbles sense)  Not sure they really have a place, or maybe just in the upper area as air from the snorkel,,,,,,</td>', 'Great capture and great processing of this image.  it meets the challenge in some way and has plently of interesting elements in it.  The title helps connect to the challenge, and this was not what I expected to see in here, but it works.  The lighting is well done, especially when you consider the depth in the image that needed to be correctly lit.  The bubbles, they provide interest, and cut up the plain black background, but the Physics nerd in me does ask ''Where do they come from'' in a scene sense (not in the blow bubbles sense)  Not sure they really have a place, or maybe just in the upper area as air from the snorkel,,,,,,', '2009-05-06 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471799, 788584, 96881, '<td valign="top">Long forgotten Rose........I like the idea, the composition here is very good.  I feel the rose is a touch dark.  I understand that you want the overall image dark, but at least on my monitor, having it a little (just a little) lighter would have made it and its details stand out just a bit more, and would have made it better........<br/> <br/>I like the border you have applied, simple and elegant, as a rose should be, and provides a contrast to the subject that works well</td>', 'Long forgotten Rose........I like the idea, the composition here is very good.  I feel the rose is a touch dark.  I understand that you want the overall image dark, but at least on my monitor, having it a little (just a little) lighter would have made it and its details stand out just a bit more, and would have made it better........ I like the border you have applied, simple and elegant, as a rose should be, and provides a contrast to the subject that works well', '2009-05-06 03:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471830, 788220, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is normally dark...........<br/>However, this photo, while technically an alright photo of an owl, struggles to really connect me to the challenge topic.  The entire image is too light.  It looks to have been taken in the day.  The colours do not contrast enough, with the owl''s head merging into the surrounding tree.  The crop also doesn''t work for me.  Tight around the bird and quiet narrow, it just seems awkward</td>', 'Yes, it is normally dark...........However, this photo, while technically an alright photo of an owl, struggles to really connect me to the challenge topic.  The entire image is too light.  It looks to have been taken in the day.  The colours do not contrast enough, with the owl''s head merging into the surrounding tree.  The crop also doesn''t work for me.  Tight around the bird and quiet narrow, it just seems awkward', '2009-05-06 03:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471833, 786626, 96881, '<td valign="top">The noise through this photo is a detraction from it.  I like the idea you had for the image, and the composition is good.  It is prehaps a touch too dark int he face as well, but that noise is the biggest problem here</td>', 'The noise through this photo is a detraction from it.  I like the idea you had for the image, and the composition is good.  It is prehaps a touch too dark int he face as well, but that noise is the biggest problem here', '2009-05-06 04:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
