(5472350, 787886, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL  I''m thinking this could be the brown.  I hope I''m wrong. Reminds me of a funny story.  There was a guarded exhibition at the Houston Gallery of Art one year.  A room with GIANT black canvases by some well known artist.  My mom and her brother sat in there laughing.  To think, they had to have an armed guard outside the door. HAHAHA</td>', 'LOL  I''m thinking this could be the brown.  I hope I''m wrong. Reminds me of a funny story.  There was a guarded exhibition at the Houston Gallery of Art one year.  A room with GIANT black canvases by some well known artist.  My mom and her brother sat in there laughing.  To think, they had to have an armed guard outside the door. HAHAHA', '2009-05-06 10:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472351, 787464, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just stunning.  The lines intersecting.  WOW Great low key.</td>', 'Just stunning.  The lines intersecting.  WOW Great low key.', '2009-05-06 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472352, 788602, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the background.  I think this is one that needs to be turned to make the line level (the sill upon which he''s sitting).</td>', 'Love the background.  I think this is one that needs to be turned to make the line level (the sill upon which he''s sitting).', '2009-05-06 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472353, 788090, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really pretty.  I like the abstractness and that pop from the turquoise.</td>', 'Really pretty.  I like the abstractness and that pop from the turquoise.', '2009-05-06 10:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472387, 788294, 101256, '<td valign="top">There''s some great detail in this image - very subtle lighting giving a rather different effect even on the third view. Obviously shot from a dark position into the light, it is very effective on both a technical and artistic standpoint. How it meets the challenge is a bit too subtle, but it is a good image.</td>', 'There''s some great detail in this image - very subtle lighting giving a rather different effect even on the third view. Obviously shot from a dark position into the light, it is very effective on both a technical and artistic standpoint. How it meets the challenge is a bit too subtle, but it is a good image.', '2009-05-06 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472391, 788729, 101256, '<td valign="top">Over processed presenting an overly dramatic image, this might have worked much better without touching it or even just a very slight touch using curves or bright/contrast controls in the processing software. The color set is very unnatural and gives a feeling of being false or artificial.</td>', 'Over processed presenting an overly dramatic image, this might have worked much better without touching it or even just a very slight touch using curves or bright/contrast controls in the processing software. The color set is very unnatural and gives a feeling of being false or artificial.', '2009-05-06 11:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472402, 787914, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good concept and from an artistic standpoint, a very good homage to the impressionist tradition, the image is way too small to be truly effective. Additionally, the frame does not enhance the effectiveness of the image from an artistic standpoint as it draws the eye away from the subject matter. This could have been a truly inspiring image worthy of ribbon contention if more thought about presentation had used.</td>', 'A very good concept and from an artistic standpoint, a very good homage to the impressionist tradition, the image is way too small to be truly effective. Additionally, the frame does not enhance the effectiveness of the image from an artistic standpoint as it draws the eye away from the subject matter. This could have been a truly inspiring image worthy of ribbon contention if more thought about presentation had used.', '2009-05-06 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472414, 787500, 101256, '<td valign="top">A silhouette in the Victorian style this image is just a little too dark to have any significant artistic or technical impact on the viewer. A little less dark highlighting the profile would have improved this image significantly creating a mood piece that would have scored well. No major technical issues are present to affect this image - it''s strictly an artistic impression that falls just short of being a top contender or ribbon winner.</td>', 'A silhouette in the Victorian style this image is just a little too dark to have any significant artistic or technical impact on the viewer. A little less dark highlighting the profile would have improved this image significantly creating a mood piece that would have scored well. No major technical issues are present to affect this image - it''s strictly an artistic impression that falls just short of being a top contender or ribbon winner.', '2009-05-06 11:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472439, 788709, 101256, '<td valign="top">Far from being an artistic success, this image has several technical issues that needed to be addressed. Besides the over done white bloom, the edges of the ball are squared off - not smooth and round as would normally be expected. It also appears to be over sharpened. Both of these issues might be due to the available lighting or lighting technique used. From an artistic standpoint, there is too much blank space contrasting directly with the over done whites and odd color of the ball. A little less exposure and more lighting control would have been a significant improvement.</td>', 'Far from being an artistic success, this image has several technical issues that needed to be addressed. Besides the over done white bloom, the edges of the ball are squared off - not smooth and round as would normally be expected. It also appears to be over sharpened. Both of these issues might be due to the available lighting or lighting technique used. From an artistic standpoint, there is too much blank space contrasting directly with the over done whites and odd color of the ball. A little less exposure and more lighting control would have been a significant improvement.', '2009-05-06 11:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472447, 788579, 101256, '<td valign="top">The crisp and sharp image conveys a sense of gentle intelligence in the very expressive face. Set against the dark background, the very slight color cast to the face of the subject is perfect - not under done, not over done. While the image could have been a little more centered in terms of top to bottom, it still is very effective and leaves a powerful artistic impression of simple elegance and grace not normally seen in animal portraits. A potential top ten image and possibly a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'The crisp and sharp image conveys a sense of gentle intelligence in the very expressive face. Set against the dark background, the very slight color cast to the face of the subject is perfect - not under done, not over done. While the image could have been a little more centered in terms of top to bottom, it still is very effective and leaves a powerful artistic impression of simple elegance and grace not normally seen in animal portraits. A potential top ten image and possibly a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-05-06 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472459, 788039, 101256, '<td valign="top">While the author''s intent is clear, a little closer look at the computer screen and subject would have improved this image significantly - there is a little too much light on the screen and not enough on the subject in addition to the rather vague focus on the monitor. In images like this, it''s always a plus to give the viewer something detailed to look at to compare to the blank space. From an artistic standpoint, there is too much blank space and it would have been better to use a little closer look at the subject.</td>', 'While the author''s intent is clear, a little closer look at the computer screen and subject would have improved this image significantly - there is a little too much light on the screen and not enough on the subject in addition to the rather vague focus on the monitor. In images like this, it''s always a plus to give the viewer something detailed to look at to compare to the blank space. From an artistic standpoint, there is too much blank space and it would have been better to use a little closer look at the subject.', '2009-05-06 11:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472463, 787553, 92577, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2009-05-06 11:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472474, 788540, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice setting - nice capture</td>', 'nice setting - nice capture', '2009-05-06 11:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472490, 788726, 28322, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this presents darkness, yet I am giving it 6, regards,</td>', 'Not sure how this presents darkness, yet I am giving it 6, regards,', '2009-05-06 12:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472494, 788552, 92577, '<td valign="top">I'' trying to figure how you did it. Possibly a sheet of tinted gel cut to shape and then some heavy blurring. - Where it meets the lamp is a giveaway.<br/>Good idea, well done. good luck</td>', 'I'' trying to figure how you did it. Possibly a sheet of tinted gel cut to shape and then some heavy blurring. - Where it meets the lamp is a giveaway.Good idea, well done. good luck', '2009-05-06 12:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472499, 788375, 92577, '<td valign="top">good effect - I can guess the source of inspiration</td>', 'good effect - I can guess the source of inspiration', '2009-05-06 12:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472504, 787821, 101256, '<td valign="top">Moonlight images are always difficult to capture and this is a very good example of why. Using grayscale, the image appears to be washed out. While very good from an artistic impression standpoint, the shadows aren''t deep (black) enough to really create a significant pop to invite the viewer to stay longer and look at the details. After viewing this for a third time, there is a lot to look at, but the image needs much more contrast to be truly effective. Use of the zone system when composing this image and a deft touch in post processing using curves to bring out it''s best features would have been a better choice.</td>', 'Moonlight images are always difficult to capture and this is a very good example of why. Using grayscale, the image appears to be washed out. While very good from an artistic impression standpoint, the shadows aren''t deep (black) enough to really create a significant pop to invite the viewer to stay longer and look at the details. After viewing this for a third time, there is a lot to look at, but the image needs much more contrast to be truly effective. Use of the zone system when composing this image and a deft touch in post processing using curves to bring out it''s best features would have been a better choice.', '2009-05-06 12:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472505, 788264, 28322, '<td valign="top">Now too bad the voting scores gives max of 10. I think tis deserves more .. Very well done,</td>', 'Now too bad the voting scores gives max of 10. I think tis deserves more .. Very well done,', '2009-05-06 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472508, 786460, 28322, '<td valign="top">one word .. I mean number .. technically they are 2 numbers :) 10 :)</td>', 'one word .. I mean number .. technically they are 2 numbers :) 10 :)', '2009-05-06 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472510, 788689, 92577, '<td valign="top">this looks great as a thumbnail but not quite as good full scale. very cozy - good luck</td>', 'this looks great as a thumbnail but not quite as good full scale. very cozy - good luck', '2009-05-06 12:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5472511, 788325, 28322, '<td valign="top">Nicely done .. 9</td>', 'Nicely done .. 9', '2009-05-06 12:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
