(5476722, 788676, 106148, '<td valign="top">Nice spin on the title, however, using a black night would have been interesting to see. There may have been enough light to get the contour of the black knight within the darkness. Still, I like it with the crystal knight too...see I''m not racist or anything, lol.<br/> <br/>oooooh, and another request/suggestion...having no border would help too, so the darkness is not constrained in that area alone, but infinite. The boundaries of shot become your border. Ok, I''m shutting up, lol.</td>', 'Nice spin on the title, however, using a black night would have been interesting to see. There may have been enough light to get the contour of the black knight within the darkness. Still, I like it with the crystal knight too...see I''m not racist or anything, lol. oooooh, and another request/suggestion...having no border would help too, so the darkness is not constrained in that area alone, but infinite. The boundaries of shot become your border. Ok, I''m shutting up, lol.', '2009-05-08 12:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476731, 787500, 106148, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like it!</td>', 'Nice, I like it!', '2009-05-08 12:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476737, 788515, 106148, '<td valign="top">Spinning within the dark. I love ice skating, this was a perfect time to take a shot. No motion blur though?....Love motion blur. I know that comment was, like, a special order, lol. NO SPECIAL ORDERS!!</td>', 'Spinning within the dark. I love ice skating, this was a perfect time to take a shot. No motion blur though?....Love motion blur. I know that comment was, like, a special order, lol. NO SPECIAL ORDERS!!', '2009-05-08 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476752, 788551, 106148, '<td valign="top">Don''t be surprised if your Darkness becomes "Blue". The contours of these particular trees leads the eys through the photograph. The only thing I don''t like are the thin twigs coming from the right top corner and the right side; the removal of these elements would really help this photo look more perfect, but this is just a suggestion...<br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Don''t be surprised if your Darkness becomes "Blue". The contours of these particular trees leads the eys through the photograph. The only thing I don''t like are the thin twigs coming from the right top corner and the right side; the removal of these elements would really help this photo look more perfect, but this is just a suggestion...Nice shot.', '2009-05-08 12:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476759, 788767, 106148, '<td valign="top">Love the silhouette and title.</td>', 'Love the silhouette and title.', '2009-05-08 12:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476783, 788560, 106148, '<td valign="top">Oh My......I don''t even know if that qualifies as a comment, but it really sums up what I think, lol. My score for this photo supports my response. I won''t be suprised at all if this photo gets "tied" up, lol. Wonderful.<br/> <br/>Can I take a guess and say this final result is a combination of multiple exposures, ''cause if it''s not....motion sickness but in a good way, lol. What makes me think so, are the trees that are very well lit to the left...they look suspect. Nevertheless, well done.</td>', 'Oh My......I don''t even know if that qualifies as a comment, but it really sums up what I think, lol. My score for this photo supports my response. I won''t be suprised at all if this photo gets "tied" up, lol. Wonderful. Can I take a guess and say this final result is a combination of multiple exposures, ''cause if it''s not....motion sickness but in a good way, lol. What makes me think so, are the trees that are very well lit to the left...they look suspect. Nevertheless, well done.', '2009-05-08 12:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476789, 787821, 106148, '<td valign="top">Quickly, in the shed.THE SNAILS ARE COMING!!! Nice. <br/>Suggestion though...try tweaking the levels of the photo; it helps when there''s a nice gradation from black to white. Rev up the levels to get areas of pure black in the photo. Interesting photo.</td>', 'Quickly, in the shed.THE SNAILS ARE COMING!!! Nice. Suggestion though...try tweaking the levels of the photo; it helps when there''s a nice gradation from black to white. Rev up the levels to get areas of pure black in the photo. Interesting photo.', '2009-05-08 12:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5476793, 788584, 106148, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, so sad. Why do I hear music from beauty and the beast?...lol.<br/>The .75 border line is a nice touch; very subtle...</td>', 'Awwwww, so sad. Why do I hear music from beauty and the beast?...lol.The .75 border line is a nice touch; very subtle...', '2009-05-08 12:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
