(5477294, 788202, 104198, '<td valign="top">If the picture were larger and less glare from the streetlight this would be a great shot. Above agerage as it is.  8</td>', 'If the picture were larger and less glare from the streetlight this would be a great shot. Above agerage as it is.  8', '2009-05-08 18:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477630, 788560, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent , one of the best I have voted on so far. Colors and exposure is good. the reflection adds to the shot. 9</td>', 'excellent , one of the best I have voted on so far. Colors and exposure is good. the reflection adds to the shot. 9', '2009-05-08 23:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477632, 788068, 79955, '<td valign="top">very well setup IMO. Wish the lighting was just a tad lower key and cooler in temperature just to be a touch more realistic. Excellent , 8</td>', 'very well setup IMO. Wish the lighting was just a tad lower key and cooler in temperature just to be a touch more realistic. Excellent , 8', '2009-05-08 23:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477637, 786611, 79955, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Nice composition. Not sure how this was lighted but the lighring is excellent , able to bring out just the right amount of details. 9</td>', 'This is excellent. Nice composition. Not sure how this was lighted but the lighring is excellent , able to bring out just the right amount of details. 9', '2009-05-09 00:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477644, 788495, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent technique !! love the timing and the reflections. Irenem like but it just seems a little grainy on my screen(maybe it is just my screen). The composition of the droplets is wonderful. 1st 10 for the challenge.</td>', 'excellent technique !! love the timing and the reflections. Irenem like but it just seems a little grainy on my screen(maybe it is just my screen). The composition of the droplets is wonderful. 1st 10 for the challenge.', '2009-05-09 00:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477646, 787538, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent clarity , very crisp. composition is excellent. This will finish high IMO, 9</td>', 'excellent clarity , very crisp. composition is excellent. This will finish high IMO, 9', '2009-05-09 00:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477659, 787651, 79955, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is brilliant and so powerful. Excellent !!! My 2nd 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'The simplicity is brilliant and so powerful. Excellent !!! My 2nd 10 for this challenge.', '2009-05-09 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477664, 788661, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent shot , crisp focus , 8</td>', 'excellent shot , crisp focus , 8', '2009-05-09 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477703, 788264, 44025, '<td valign="top">creepy!! looks like animation...interesting shot.</td>', 'creepy!! looks like animation...interesting shot.', '2009-05-09 01:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477705, 788438, 44025, '<td valign="top">nice texture!!</td>', 'nice texture!!', '2009-05-09 01:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477707, 787538, 44025, '<td valign="top">a lovely, rich image...9</td>', 'a lovely, rich image...9', '2009-05-09 01:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477709, 788580, 44025, '<td valign="top">i love the light in this shot!</td>', 'i love the light in this shot!', '2009-05-09 01:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477714, 787372, 44025, '<td valign="top">would like to see the buildings sharpened and maybe crop out the smaller buildings up top. has great potential!</td>', 'would like to see the buildings sharpened and maybe crop out the smaller buildings up top. has great potential!', '2009-05-09 01:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477715, 788726, 44025, '<td valign="top">LOVE the detail in the eyes!!</td>', 'LOVE the detail in the eyes!!', '2009-05-09 01:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477810, 788375, 83544, '<td valign="top">I like what you have done with the lighting, I''m puzzled where it comes from :), is under the puzzle or there are two light sources</td>', 'I like what you have done with the lighting, I''m puzzled where it comes from :), is under the puzzle or there are two light sources', '2009-05-09 04:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477967, 788742, 100335, '<td valign="top">Stunning, i wonder what lens you used for this. I love the texture at the bottom side of the moon. Almost within an arms length.</td>', 'Stunning, i wonder what lens you used for this. I love the texture at the bottom side of the moon. Almost within an arms length.', '2009-05-09 10:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477968, 788551, 100335, '<td valign="top">I like this, one of the top for me in the challenge so far. BUT (theres always a but) i personally dont like the way the trees are sticking out from the left side. 8</td>', 'I like this, one of the top for me in the challenge so far. BUT (theres always a but) i personally dont like the way the trees are sticking out from the left side. 8', '2009-05-09 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477969, 788489, 100335, '<td valign="top">Pigeons??</td>', 'Pigeons??', '2009-05-09 10:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477971, 788763, 100335, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but this doesnt suggest "darkness" to me.</td>', 'A nice shot, but this doesnt suggest "darkness" to me.', '2009-05-09 10:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477972, 787553, 100335, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Apocalypse Now...</td>', 'Reminds me of Apocalypse Now...', '2009-05-09 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477973, 788598, 100335, '<td valign="top">I love your idea. But a little too much black space, maybe a tighter crop would have been in order (just my opinion)</td>', 'I love your idea. But a little too much black space, maybe a tighter crop would have been in order (just my opinion)', '2009-05-09 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5477974, 787223, 100335, '<td valign="top">Good expression.</td>', 'Good expression.', '2009-05-09 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478058, 787886, 106404, '<td valign="top">This is...different xD</td>', 'This is...different xD', '2009-05-09 11:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478063, 787897, 106404, '<td valign="top">Hm, I like the idea really much, but in my opinion it wouldve been better without this grey layer everywhere...</td>', 'Hm, I like the idea really much, but in my opinion it wouldve been better without this grey layer everywhere...', '2009-05-09 11:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478361, 787651, 101445, '<td valign="top">wonderfully composed, one of my favorites of the challenge, 9</td>', 'wonderfully composed, one of my favorites of the challenge, 9', '2009-05-09 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478362, 787223, 101445, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites of the challenge, 9</td>', 'one of my favorites of the challenge, 9', '2009-05-09 15:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478364, 788458, 101445, '<td valign="top">superb use of light and darkness , 8</td>', 'superb use of light and darkness , 8', '2009-05-09 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478393, 788528, 37845, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, and the shutter was good. I think it could be improved by an even longer shutter though... but that is just a personal preference.</td>', 'Really nice shot, and the shutter was good. I think it could be improved by an even longer shutter though... but that is just a personal preference.', '2009-05-09 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478394, 788290, 37845, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is very good, and i like the isolation of your subject against the darkness in the b/g. i think the focus is a little soft though.</td>', 'I think the lighting is very good, and i like the isolation of your subject against the darkness in the b/g. i think the focus is a little soft though.', '2009-05-09 16:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478396, 788730, 37845, '<td valign="top">Really nice as an abstract image. I like how the light trails were processed in the lower right.</td>', 'Really nice as an abstract image. I like how the light trails were processed in the lower right.', '2009-05-09 16:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478397, 787731, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette of these trees. The sky has good character to it.</td>', 'Nice silhouette of these trees. The sky has good character to it.', '2009-05-09 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478398, 788551, 37845, '<td valign="top">These are awesome brooding trees. I like how they seem to be reaching over the viewer. Nice shot.</td>', 'These are awesome brooding trees. I like how they seem to be reaching over the viewer. Nice shot.', '2009-05-09 16:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478399, 788522, 37845, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is superb, and the emotion expressed by the subject is effective. Good Shot.</td>', 'The lighting on this is superb, and the emotion expressed by the subject is effective. Good Shot.', '2009-05-09 16:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478402, 788254, 37845, '<td valign="top">At first I thought these were just poorly or overprocessed flowers.... but the blacklighting is very creative. I hope other voters take the time to appreciate this one as well.</td>', 'At first I thought these were just poorly or overprocessed flowers.... but the blacklighting is very creative. I hope other voters take the time to appreciate this one as well.', '2009-05-09 16:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478417, 788742, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very good shot of the moon. Shots like yours make it look easy, but I know from experience how difficult it really is.</td>', 'Very good shot of the moon. Shots like yours make it look easy, but I know from experience how difficult it really is.', '2009-05-09 17:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478418, 788580, 37845, '<td valign="top">The reflection off the water is really calming. Nice shot.</td>', 'The reflection off the water is really calming. Nice shot.', '2009-05-09 17:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478424, 788144, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very dark and brooding shot. Well executed.</td>', 'Very dark and brooding shot. Well executed.', '2009-05-09 17:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478428, 788199, 37845, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot, but overall, it is very noisy. Not sure if that was intentional or not, but I would have preferred it without the noise.</td>', 'Well composed shot, but overall, it is very noisy. Not sure if that was intentional or not, but I would have preferred it without the noise.', '2009-05-09 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478431, 788520, 37845, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot the leaves me questioning who the green cloaked figure is.</td>', 'Intriguing shot the leaves me questioning who the green cloaked figure is.', '2009-05-09 17:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478432, 788220, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this owl, but overall it has only loose connections to the theme of Darkness.</td>', 'Nice shot of this owl, but overall it has only loose connections to the theme of Darkness.', '2009-05-09 17:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478433, 787480, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cool effect with the multiple exposure. The blurred figure on the left feels out of place though, but still a nice shot overall.</td>', 'Cool effect with the multiple exposure. The blurred figure on the left feels out of place though, but still a nice shot overall.', '2009-05-09 17:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478434, 788626, 37845, '<td valign="top">I see you have been to my house :)<br/> <br/>I wish. <br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'I see you have been to my house :) I wish.  Nice shot.', '2009-05-09 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478506, 787019, 23002, '<td valign="top">Nice use of OCF</td>', 'Nice use of OCF', '2009-05-09 19:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478710, 787711, 97475, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2009-05-09 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478711, 787924, 97475, '<td valign="top">The main subject is not in focus, a bit blur.</td>', 'The main subject is not in focus, a bit blur.', '2009-05-09 23:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478731, 788194, 97475, '<td valign="top">A tiny bright golden spot on the bottom is really distracting.</td>', 'A tiny bright golden spot on the bottom is really distracting.', '2009-05-09 23:40:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5478932, 788579, 71244, '<td valign="top">oh. i love this. tack sharp too.</td>', 'oh. i love this. tack sharp too.', '2009-05-10 02:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478966, 788751, 70000, '<td valign="top">The composition of this doesn''t do much for me. The color is disconcerting though, and I like it when a picture does more than just please the eye.</td>', 'The composition of this doesn''t do much for me. The color is disconcerting though, and I like it when a picture does more than just please the eye.', '2009-05-10 04:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478967, 786611, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very cool lighting. Interesting location too.</td>', 'Very cool lighting. Interesting location too.', '2009-05-10 04:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478968, 788551, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I love the texture in the branches and the different shapes coming from the other tree.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I love the texture in the branches and the different shapes coming from the other tree.', '2009-05-10 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478969, 787951, 70000, '<td valign="top">Adorable and well thought out concept. The colors are so warm that it makes it a little sickly looking though. This would be dynamite in bw.</td>', 'Adorable and well thought out concept. The colors are so warm that it makes it a little sickly looking though. This would be dynamite in bw.', '2009-05-10 04:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478970, 787464, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very unique lighting. Normally people take these and make these look so soft, but I love the contrasting sharpness this has. Very cool</td>', 'Very unique lighting. Normally people take these and make these look so soft, but I love the contrasting sharpness this has. Very cool', '2009-05-10 04:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478972, 788451, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot, though I think adding the ISO setting in the title was probably unnecessary.</td>', 'This is a very cool shot, though I think adding the ISO setting in the title was probably unnecessary.', '2009-05-10 04:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479021, 788751, 14867, '<td valign="top">Very good with simple means. Excellent use of colors</td>', 'Very good with simple means. Excellent use of colors', '2009-05-10 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479186, 787352, 104849, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Bravo!</td>', 'Spectacular! Bravo!', '2009-05-10 12:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479189, 788458, 106726, '<td valign="top">Instant fave!</td>', 'Instant fave!', '2009-05-10 12:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479272, 788068, 102811, '<td valign="top">The moment I saw this I just loved it. The colours, the post processing and the quirkyness of the shot. I have my suspicions who''s work it is but I''ll wait and see. Very interesting interpretation of the challenge and a great photo. Best of luck.</td>', 'The moment I saw this I just loved it. The colours, the post processing and the quirkyness of the shot. I have my suspicions who''s work it is but I''ll wait and see. Very interesting interpretation of the challenge and a great photo. Best of luck.', '2009-05-10 14:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479273, 788325, 102811, '<td valign="top">Very unsettling shot, cleverly done technically. Captures both interpretations of the challenge well. good luck</td>', 'Very unsettling shot, cleverly done technically. Captures both interpretations of the challenge well. good luck', '2009-05-10 14:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479308, 788626, 33552, '<td valign="top">I love this! The lines, the colors, the contrast between the straight man-made edges and the organic form of the tree!</td>', 'I love this! The lines, the colors, the contrast between the straight man-made edges and the organic form of the tree!', '2009-05-10 14:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479311, 788638, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the full range of tones in a low key!</td>', 'Very nice use of the full range of tones in a low key!', '2009-05-10 14:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479314, 788578, 33552, '<td valign="top">The square crop and round vignette betray the chaos portrayed by the model. Otherwise I think this works.</td>', 'The square crop and round vignette betray the chaos portrayed by the model. Otherwise I think this works.', '2009-05-10 14:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479317, 788375, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Was it all lit by the, um, under-puzzle source, or is there a second light on the face? I''m guessing the former, but I''m <strike>a bit puzzled</strike>, um, having trouble working it out.</td>', 'Very nice! Was it all lit by the, um, under-puzzle source, or is there a second light on the face? I''m guessing the former, but I''m a bit puzzled, um, having trouble working it out.', '2009-05-10 14:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479321, 788068, 33552, '<td valign="top">I usually dislike kid-shots, but I can''t take anything away here. Great job! It''s great as is, but I would consider a partial blue gel or post processing to keep the face/hands/foreground properly colored while giving the legs/background an underwater feel. It might add depth.</td>', 'I usually dislike kid-shots, but I can''t take anything away here. Great job! It''s great as is, but I would consider a partial blue gel or post processing to keep the face/hands/foreground properly colored while giving the legs/background an underwater feel. It might add depth.', '2009-05-10 14:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479323, 788644, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like that you abruptly cut off the chin while letting the forehead fade to black. It works.</td>', 'I like that you abruptly cut off the chin while letting the forehead fade to black. It works.', '2009-05-10 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479324, 788202, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, but my eye goes straight to the lamp. I didn''t even see the swings for quite some time. Also, I can''t say exactly why, but I want to see this shot move... track right... slowly... revealing...something.  Wierd.</td>', 'Nice tones, but my eye goes straight to the lamp. I didn''t even see the swings for quite some time. Also, I can''t say exactly why, but I want to see this shot move... track right... slowly... revealing...something.  Wierd.', '2009-05-10 14:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479325, 788352, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Throw a bit more light on the base to really dazzle em!</td>', 'Nicely done. Throw a bit more light on the base to really dazzle em!', '2009-05-10 14:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479326, 788677, 33552, '<td valign="top">The cluttered bits kinda ruin this shot for me, but I love the concept. Use this as a starting point for a really cool, and distinctive, technique. I think you''re on to something here, it just needs a little refinement.</td>', 'The cluttered bits kinda ruin this shot for me, but I love the concept. Use this as a starting point for a really cool, and distinctive, technique. I think you''re on to something here, it just needs a little refinement.', '2009-05-10 14:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479327, 788554, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice night scene, but I''m lacking an interesting focal point. Dig a bit deeper into the scene and feature something that tells a story.</td>', 'Nice night scene, but I''m lacking an interesting focal point. Dig a bit deeper into the scene and feature something that tells a story.', '2009-05-10 15:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479328, 788245, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow, but I might suggest a different crop. The fist-like thing in the lower right is really distracting.</td>', 'Nice shadow, but I might suggest a different crop. The fist-like thing in the lower right is really distracting.', '2009-05-10 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479333, 788294, 33552, '<td valign="top">My eye goes straight to the worker''s vest and helmet, but there''s so much texture and pattern throughout that I can''t settle on a central subject.</td>', 'My eye goes straight to the worker''s vest and helmet, but there''s so much texture and pattern throughout that I can''t settle on a central subject.', '2009-05-10 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479340, 788533, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very well done in a technical sense, but a bit bland. Great for stock, but I want to see a different take here. I''ll still score well, as the shot works, but I''m not really feeling it.<br/> <br/>Edit to add: I dont really want to sound too harsh, but you''ve obviously got the technical skill. I want to see more. Maybe I''m just getting jaded :)</td>', 'Very well done in a technical sense, but a bit bland. Great for stock, but I want to see a different take here. I''ll still score well, as the shot works, but I''m not really feeling it. Edit to add: I dont really want to sound too harsh, but you''ve obviously got the technical skill. I want to see more. Maybe I''m just getting jaded :)', '2009-05-10 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479343, 786500, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene, but push the contrast a bit further.</td>', 'Very nice scene, but push the contrast a bit further.', '2009-05-10 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479345, 788540, 102811, '<td valign="top">I find there is something ambigious about this picture (although the title perhaps gives away the intention). To me the poses does not unquestionalbly mean love. The guy looks perhaps menancing, the girl submissive or afraid. An there lies the charm of this picture, despite the title there are unanswered questions. Good luck for the remainder of the challenge.</td>', 'I find there is something ambigious about this picture (although the title perhaps gives away the intention). To me the poses does not unquestionalbly mean love. The guy looks perhaps menancing, the girl submissive or afraid. An there lies the charm of this picture, despite the title there are unanswered questions. Good luck for the remainder of the challenge.', '2009-05-10 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479350, 788052, 33552, '<td valign="top">This has a lot going for it, it could stand a bit of photoshop abuse. Try pushing the contrast a bit, and maybe cooling the colors slightly to bring out emrald green grass.</td>', 'This has a lot going for it, it could stand a bit of photoshop abuse. Try pushing the contrast a bit, and maybe cooling the colors slightly to bring out emrald green grass.', '2009-05-10 15:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479353, 788500, 33552, '<td valign="top">There''s some nice ideas at work here, but try to use the whole frame. I''d be tempted to really go fo a cinematic look here, starting with a wide format crop.</td>', 'There''s some nice ideas at work here, but try to use the whole frame. I''d be tempted to really go fo a cinematic look here, starting with a wide format crop.', '2009-05-10 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479354, 788403, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like the extreme vertical format here. Great mood.</td>', 'I like the extreme vertical format here. Great mood.', '2009-05-10 15:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5479356, 788645, 33552, '<td valign="top">Watch the camera shake on those long exposures. This is where those big bucks tripods pay off... unless the bridge you''re standing on is to blame ;)</td>', 'Watch the camera shake on those long exposures. This is where those big bucks tripods pay off... unless the bridge you''re standing on is to blame ;)', '2009-05-10 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
