(5482460, 788548, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good clarity. The image seems to be tilted lower on the right side but otherwise a good take.</td>', 'Nice capture and good clarity. The image seems to be tilted lower on the right side but otherwise a good take.', '2009-05-12 19:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482471, 786611, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well lit shot. Although the clouds are a little grainy, I like the way the sky darkens as you look to the right side of the image..</td>', 'Well lit shot. Although the clouds are a little grainy, I like the way the sky darkens as you look to the right side of the image..', '2009-05-12 19:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482473, 788522, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lighting, position and perspective made this an excellent capture. The blending of the dark t-shirt and back ground add to the mood of the shot. Well executed.</td>', 'Lighting, position and perspective made this an excellent capture. The blending of the dark t-shirt and back ground add to the mood of the shot. Well executed.', '2009-05-12 19:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482475, 787785, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely tone in this shot and I like the positioning in the frame. Would have liked to see a greater DOF to capture a bit more clarity in the fronds but still a nice shot all the same.</td>', 'Lovely tone in this shot and I like the positioning in the frame. Would have liked to see a greater DOF to capture a bit more clarity in the fronds but still a nice shot all the same.', '2009-05-12 19:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482478, 787651, 94235, '<td valign="top">Simple tones with the lights immediately capturing the viewer''s eye make this a very successful entry for the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Simple tones with the lights immediately capturing the viewer''s eye make this a very successful entry for the challenge. Well done.', '2009-05-12 19:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482481, 788626, 94235, '<td valign="top">The solid black background make the colors in this shot jump out at you. Great clarity, well framed and a very pleasing capture to look at.</td>', 'The solid black background make the colors in this shot jump out at you. Great clarity, well framed and a very pleasing capture to look at.', '2009-05-12 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482486, 788451, 94235, '<td valign="top">The clarity and solid background make this shot look a little surreal to me. Great shot but my only nit pick would have been to crop a little tighter on the right side for balance. Well done all the same.</td>', 'The clarity and solid background make this shot look a little surreal to me. Great shot but my only nit pick would have been to crop a little tighter on the right side for balance. Well done all the same.', '2009-05-12 19:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482487, 788321, 94235, '<td valign="top">Like the effect that the house is surrounded by the impending darkness but the pylons and the house still remain well exposed. Great effort.</td>', 'Like the effect that the house is surrounded by the impending darkness but the pylons and the house still remain well exposed. Great effort.', '2009-05-12 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482490, 788680, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well lit and nice use of empty space. IMO the image looks a little blurred but I''ve still scored this one well.</td>', 'Well lit and nice use of empty space. IMO the image looks a little blurred but I''ve still scored this one well.', '2009-05-12 19:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482493, 788604, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and well framed shot. Would have liked to see lighting on the smaller mushroom the same as the bigger one, as the highlight near the eye tends to catch my attention first. Nice capture all the same.</td>', 'Nice textures and well framed shot. Would have liked to see lighting on the smaller mushroom the same as the bigger one, as the highlight near the eye tends to catch my attention first. Nice capture all the same.', '2009-05-12 19:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482527, 787924, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! Subject looks a little OOF, otherwise a very clever shot.</td>', 'Great perspective! Subject looks a little OOF, otherwise a very clever shot.', '2009-05-12 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482531, 788742, 94235, '<td valign="top">Simple, great sharpness and a well framed shot. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Simple, great sharpness and a well framed shot. Nicely captured.', '2009-05-12 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482533, 788537, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great tones. It does look like some sort of alien!</td>', 'Great tones. It does look like some sort of alien!', '2009-05-12 19:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482536, 788748, 94235, '<td valign="top">Might have tried a tighter crop on the left to take out the grainy section but the title suits the subject aptly and the effect on the flower and the choice of b&amp;w is superb.</td>', 'Might have tried a tighter crop on the left to take out the grainy section but the title suits the subject aptly and the effect on the flower and the choice of b&w is superb.', '2009-05-12 20:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482563, 787352, 94235, '<td valign="top">Cool editing and well lit shot. Great smile!</td>', 'Cool editing and well lit shot. Great smile!', '2009-05-12 20:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482570, 787019, 94235, '<td valign="top">Foreground subject and colors are great but the blurriness of the pier detracts from the shot IMO.</td>', 'Foreground subject and colors are great but the blurriness of the pier detracts from the shot IMO.', '2009-05-12 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482586, 788204, 94235, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of how the light gently fades across the subject. The positioning and use of vacant space also adds to the shot.</td>', 'I like the effect of how the light gently fades across the subject. The positioning and use of vacant space also adds to the shot.', '2009-05-12 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482595, 787894, 94235, '<td valign="top">The monotone look and the outline of the closer rocks gives this pic an eerie feel. The blown out horizon detracts a little but not enough to deter from the overall mood of the shot.</td>', 'The monotone look and the outline of the closer rocks gives this pic an eerie feel. The blown out horizon detracts a little but not enough to deter from the overall mood of the shot.', '2009-05-12 20:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482600, 788584, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well processed. Looks like a painting and very well done if that is the effect you were looking for.</td>', 'Well processed. Looks like a painting and very well done if that is the effect you were looking for.', '2009-05-12 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482613, 788714, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great textures and mood to this shot. The detail and sharpness in the leaf edge is a standout. Well captured.</td>', 'Great textures and mood to this shot. The detail and sharpness in the leaf edge is a standout. Well captured.', '2009-05-12 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482629, 787830, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and well lit. The darker patches around the eye are a little too severe IMO but it does not detract from a clever take. Well done.</td>', 'Nice perspective and well lit. The darker patches around the eye are a little too severe IMO but it does not detract from a clever take. Well done.', '2009-05-12 21:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482633, 788533, 94235, '<td valign="top">The position of the eyes makes this an appealing shot for the challenge. Looking into the void could have been another apt title.</td>', 'The position of the eyes makes this an appealing shot for the challenge. Looking into the void could have been another apt title.', '2009-05-12 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482634, 788264, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing. The subject must have brushed a self portrait by the look of the paint left over on her hands!  ;-)</td>', 'Nice post processing. The subject must have brushed a self portrait by the look of the paint left over on her hands!  ;-)', '2009-05-12 21:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482635, 788676, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great feel to this one. Well positioned, lit and framed.</td>', 'Great feel to this one. Well positioned, lit and framed.', '2009-05-12 21:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482637, 788579, 94235, '<td valign="top">The detail and clarity in this shot are excellent. Don''t really like frames but a small pinstripe just inside the edges would have complimented this shot nicely IMO.</td>', 'The detail and clarity in this shot are excellent. Don''t really like frames but a small pinstripe just inside the edges would have complimented this shot nicely IMO.', '2009-05-12 21:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482638, 788763, 94235, '<td valign="top">The solid dark background brings out the subjects in this shot nicely. Good capture.</td>', 'The solid dark background brings out the subjects in this shot nicely. Good capture.', '2009-05-12 21:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482639, 787223, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good portrait. May have cropped a little tighter at the bottom, for balance but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Good portrait. May have cropped a little tighter at the bottom, for balance but still a nice shot.', '2009-05-12 21:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482642, 787951, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge although the blown out fridge light tends to spoil the shot a little IMO. Well set up and captured!</td>', 'Great take on the challenge although the blown out fridge light tends to spoil the shot a little IMO. Well set up and captured!', '2009-05-12 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482644, 788375, 94235, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like the shadow cast on the subject''s face but after taking another look the puzzle piece outline actually adds to the shot. Well captured.</td>', 'At first I didn''t like the shadow cast on the subject''s face but after taking another look the puzzle piece outline actually adds to the shot. Well captured.', '2009-05-12 21:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482645, 788661, 94235, '<td valign="top">Cool DOF. It actually adds to the overall feel of the shot, as though it is deep down in the depths. Well executed.</td>', 'Cool DOF. It actually adds to the overall feel of the shot, as though it is deep down in the depths. Well executed.', '2009-05-12 21:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482646, 788726, 94235, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a little sharper but the effect in the eye is a standout. Well captured.</td>', 'Focus could be a little sharper but the effect in the eye is a standout. Well captured.', '2009-05-12 21:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482648, 788564, 94235, '<td valign="top">The murky reflection of the cloud around the boats really adds to the mood in this shot. May have cropped out a little more of the rock wall as that tends to capture my eye and take away the mood of the setting.</td>', 'The murky reflection of the cloud around the boats really adds to the mood in this shot. May have cropped out a little more of the rock wall as that tends to capture my eye and take away the mood of the setting.', '2009-05-12 21:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482672, 788540, 94235, '<td valign="top">The position of her hand makes it look like he has a pony tail and the dark object near his middle back tends to be the first things that capture my eye. Setting is excellent and the lighting of the handrail add to an otherwise interesting shot.</td>', 'The position of her hand makes it look like he has a pony tail and the dark object near his middle back tends to be the first things that capture my eye. Setting is excellent and the lighting of the handrail add to an otherwise interesting shot.', '2009-05-12 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482675, 788263, 94235, '<td valign="top">The dark voids under the bridge help to highlight the colors and texture of the rest of the shot. Well captured.</td>', 'The dark voids under the bridge help to highlight the colors and texture of the rest of the shot. Well captured.', '2009-05-12 21:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482682, 787731, 94235, '<td valign="top">The cloud color behind the main subject adds volumes. The framing of the dark cloud up top and the dark ground finishes the shot off nicely.</td>', 'The cloud color behind the main subject adds volumes. The framing of the dark cloud up top and the dark ground finishes the shot off nicely.', '2009-05-12 21:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482683, 788726, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced subject, excellent bokeh.  I feel that the color may have been slightly oversaturated, reducing the insect''s sharpness.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Nicely balanced subject, excellent bokeh.  I feel that the color may have been slightly oversaturated, reducing the insect''s sharpness.  Beautiful image.', '2009-05-12 21:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482684, 788638, 94235, '<td valign="top">Used the lighting well to capture the lines. May have cropped more at the top or less at the bottom to add an even balance to the shot.</td>', 'Used the lighting well to capture the lines. May have cropped more at the top or less at the bottom to add an even balance to the shot.', '2009-05-12 21:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482688, 788559, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of selective desat, but the shot in general is a bit murky, and the bead chain is distracting, especially next to the face.</td>', 'Interesting use of selective desat, but the shot in general is a bit murky, and the bead chain is distracting, especially next to the face.', '2009-05-12 21:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482689, 787838, 94235, '<td valign="top">Like the idea behind this shot. IMO it needs to be a little darker to add a bit more of an eerie feel to the setting. Nice capture all the same.</td>', 'Like the idea behind this shot. IMO it needs to be a little darker to add a bit more of an eerie feel to the setting. Nice capture all the same.', '2009-05-12 21:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482690, 788003, 96751, '<td valign="top">Good concept and nice details, but the lighting is a bit yellow, and the subject seems slightly blurred.</td>', 'Good concept and nice details, but the lighting is a bit yellow, and the subject seems slightly blurred.', '2009-05-12 21:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482692, 788459, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and great framing using the thirds rule.</td>', 'Nice capture and great framing using the thirds rule.', '2009-05-12 21:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482693, 788644, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great intensity in the eye, but the desat doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Great intensity in the eye, but the desat doesn''t work for me.', '2009-05-12 21:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482695, 788495, 96751, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful lighting.  I love the tiny drops, and the strong lighting and texture contrast between the sharp drops and the softly rippled surface.</td>', 'Really wonderful lighting.  I love the tiny drops, and the strong lighting and texture contrast between the sharp drops and the softly rippled surface.', '2009-05-12 22:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482696, 788551, 94235, '<td valign="top">I feel the trees are about to engulf the viewer and your aim has been met admirably in this shot. Great perspective and I''m marking you up from my first vote.</td>', 'I feel the trees are about to engulf the viewer and your aim has been met admirably in this shot. Great perspective and I''m marking you up from my first vote.', '2009-05-12 22:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482697, 788500, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing capture.  The lighting on the sink is very mysterious, as is the silhouette, but the back lighting may be a bit harsh and keeps drawing my eye away from exploring the far more interesting blue area.</td>', 'Very intriguing capture.  The lighting on the sink is very mysterious, as is the silhouette, but the back lighting may be a bit harsh and keeps drawing my eye away from exploring the far more interesting blue area.', '2009-05-12 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482699, 788515, 94235, '<td valign="top">Solid background adds to the colors and action in this capture. Well taken.</td>', 'Solid background adds to the colors and action in this capture. Well taken.', '2009-05-12 22:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482700, 788019, 96751, '<td valign="top">The powerful content of this capture is marred by the snapshot quality of the lighting and composition.</td>', 'The powerful content of this capture is marred by the snapshot quality of the lighting and composition.', '2009-05-12 22:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482701, 788580, 94235, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful!</td>', 'Simply beautiful!', '2009-05-12 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482703, 788399, 96751, '<td valign="top">This subject requires more lighting and contrast to bring out the skin tones and the texture of the instrument.  I also think a third of the right side could easily have been cropped for tighter composition.</td>', 'This subject requires more lighting and contrast to bring out the skin tones and the texture of the instrument.  I also think a third of the right side could easily have been cropped for tighter composition.', '2009-05-12 22:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482705, 788502, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very groovy.  Love the colors.</td>', 'Very groovy.  Love the colors.', '2009-05-12 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482706, 787464, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great detail and softness.</td>', 'Great detail and softness.', '2009-05-12 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482707, 788202, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good clear shot but the blown out light tends to detract from the scene a little.</td>', 'Good clear shot but the blown out light tends to detract from the scene a little.', '2009-05-12 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482708, 788551, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2009-05-12 22:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482709, 788548, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the motion blur of the ferris wheel.</td>', 'Love the motion blur of the ferris wheel.', '2009-05-12 22:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482711, 787651, 96751, '<td valign="top">Simple but very effective.  Nice clean shot.  Very lovely abstract.</td>', 'Simple but very effective.  Nice clean shot.  Very lovely abstract.', '2009-05-12 22:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482714, 788321, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like a charcoal sketch.  Very nice, but feels just a tad flat.</td>', 'This looks like a charcoal sketch.  Very nice, but feels just a tad flat.', '2009-05-12 22:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482715, 788334, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and focus on the strings. The blur of the edge of the base plate is a little distracting IMO, but still a top shot.</td>', 'Great lighting and focus on the strings. The blur of the edge of the base plate is a little distracting IMO, but still a top shot.', '2009-05-12 22:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482716, 788458, 96751, '<td valign="top">Haunting and beautiful, but a bit overprocessed for me.</td>', 'Haunting and beautiful, but a bit overprocessed for me.', '2009-05-12 22:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482718, 787019, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lover her exuberance, and the incongruity of the location.  Just wish the lighting had been less harsh, or a bit more like "twilight".  It pulls me out of a natural mood, and makes her seem artificial.</td>', 'Lover her exuberance, and the incongruity of the location.  Just wish the lighting had been less harsh, or a bit more like "twilight".  It pulls me out of a natural mood, and makes her seem artificial.', '2009-05-12 22:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482721, 788194, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well positioned and lit. May have excluded the black border as it is only really visible on the right side and distracts me from the subject a little.</td>', 'Well positioned and lit. May have excluded the black border as it is only really visible on the right side and distracts me from the subject a little.', '2009-05-12 22:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482723, 787383, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of negative space.  I like the glow around the lamps, but they themselves are a bit overblown.</td>', 'Excellent use of negative space.  I like the glow around the lamps, but they themselves are a bit overblown.', '2009-05-12 22:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482724, 788352, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good effect having the light shining in total darkness. Like the positioning in the frame as well.</td>', 'Good effect having the light shining in total darkness. Like the positioning in the frame as well.', '2009-05-12 22:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482725, 787830, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very evocative image.  Nice b/w treatment.</td>', 'Very evocative image.  Nice b/w treatment.', '2009-05-12 22:08:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5482727, 787944, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so spooky.  I''m guessing the darkness was applied in pp, since it seems the sun is at his back.  Or it''s a VERY bright moon...</td>', 'This is so spooky.  I''m guessing the darkness was applied in pp, since it seems the sun is at his back.  Or it''s a VERY bright moon...', '2009-05-12 22:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482728, 788039, 94235, '<td valign="top">Completed you objective well here. I would have liked to see the subject a tad closer but well taken all the same.</td>', 'Completed you objective well here. I would have liked to see the subject a tad closer but well taken all the same.', '2009-05-12 22:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482729, 788197, 94235, '<td valign="top">Positioning and shadow makes this shot. Well thought out and captured.</td>', 'Positioning and shadow makes this shot. Well thought out and captured.', '2009-05-12 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482730, 788676, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry, although the soft lighting feels a bit too soft.  And I can''t decide about the border.  It''s almost stronger than the subject, but also really frames the subject.  Hmmmm....</td>', 'Great symmetry, although the soft lighting feels a bit too soft.  And I can''t decide about the border.  It''s almost stronger than the subject, but also really frames the subject.  Hmmmm....', '2009-05-12 22:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482732, 788602, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and background. Subject looks a little OOF to me.</td>', 'Good lighting and background. Subject looks a little OOF to me.', '2009-05-12 22:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482733, 788714, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely b/w.</td>', 'Lovely b/w.', '2009-05-12 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482734, 787828, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this splash abstract.  The background is so mysterious, and the colors very intriguing.</td>', 'I love this splash abstract.  The background is so mysterious, and the colors very intriguing.', '2009-05-12 22:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482735, 787372, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, but a bit blurred.</td>', 'Nice perspective, but a bit blurred.', '2009-05-12 22:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482736, 788515, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great action capture, which feels a bit shoehorned to me...</td>', 'Great action capture, which feels a bit shoehorned to me...', '2009-05-12 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482738, 787924, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet candid.  Just a bit blurry.</td>', 'Very sweet candid.  Just a bit blurry.', '2009-05-12 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482744, 788204, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the angle on this.  The brighter backlit petals frame the darkened face and make it more mysterious.  Lovely work, even if the focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the angle on this.  The brighter backlit petals frame the darkened face and make it more mysterious.  Lovely work, even if the focus is a bit soft.', '2009-05-12 22:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482748, 788528, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the delicacy of this shot.  The star trails, the structure in the water.  And the narrow color band really works on this.</td>', 'Love the delicacy of this shot.  The star trails, the structure in the water.  And the narrow color band really works on this.', '2009-05-12 22:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482749, 787785, 96751, '<td valign="top">A subject that cannot be photographed enough :-)  Lacking a bit of lighting dynamics.</td>', 'A subject that cannot be photographed enough :-)  Lacking a bit of lighting dynamics.', '2009-05-12 22:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482750, 788254, 94235, '<td valign="top">Interesting take and well executed. Only nit pick is that I would have tried to center the flowers in this type of shot.</td>', 'Interesting take and well executed. Only nit pick is that I would have tried to center the flowers in this type of shot.', '2009-05-12 22:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482752, 787317, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well captured.</td>', 'Well captured.', '2009-05-12 22:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482770, 786308, 94235, '<td valign="top">Like the way the lights taper off into the void. Well captured.</td>', 'Like the way the lights taper off into the void. Well captured.', '2009-05-12 22:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482773, 787821, 94235, '<td valign="top">The subtle lighting brings out the objective in this shot. Good perspective and well captured.</td>', 'The subtle lighting brings out the objective in this shot. Good perspective and well captured.', '2009-05-12 22:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482778, 787660, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well framed and captured. The b&amp;w effect makes it look like a shot from the 50''s.</td>', 'Well framed and captured. The b&w effect makes it look like a shot from the 50''s.', '2009-05-12 22:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482779, 788348, 94235, '<td valign="top">Jagged edge around the window makes for an interesting frame. Would have tried to center it in the shot a bit more and maybe darkened the shot a little to lessen the effect of the plain sky. Good perspective all the same.</td>', 'Jagged edge around the window makes for an interesting frame. Would have tried to center it in the shot a bit more and maybe darkened the shot a little to lessen the effect of the plain sky. Good perspective all the same.', '2009-05-12 22:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482784, 787034, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great colors and a nice effect using the solid black background.</td>', 'Great colors and a nice effect using the solid black background.', '2009-05-12 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482787, 787480, 94235, '<td valign="top">The positioning and the effect of the hair on the right side adds beautifully to this shot.</td>', 'The positioning and the effect of the hair on the right side adds beautifully to this shot.', '2009-05-12 22:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482793, 788245, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well taken and good use of lighting. The object in the foreground is a little distracting though.</td>', 'Well taken and good use of lighting. The object in the foreground is a little distracting though.', '2009-05-12 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
