(5484565, 788202, 103306, '<td valign="top">thanks for all of your constructive comments and critiques.  i really appreciate that you took the time to review and comment your thoughts and suggestions.  i''m new to all of this (website and photography), and it seems like this site has a great group of people who appreciate the art. thanks again.</td>', 'thanks for all of your constructive comments and critiques.  i really appreciate that you took the time to review and comment your thoughts and suggestions.  i''m new to all of this (website and photography), and it seems like this site has a great group of people who appreciate the art. thanks again.', '2009-05-13 16:17:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484587, 788458, 3746, '<td valign="top">Hi Mak, great shot - however one little nit pick - on my wide gamut monitor there is a very noisy silver of green shading to the left side of the model, just near her veil. Cant see it on a standard monitor so guess its not a problem - and you did ribbon .. well done.</td>', 'Hi Mak, great shot - however one little nit pick - on my wide gamut monitor there is a very noisy silver of green shading to the left side of the model, just near her veil. Cant see it on a standard monitor so guess its not a problem - and you did ribbon .. well done.', '2009-05-13 16:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484622, 788459, 102811, '<td valign="top">I really hoped this would do much better and was convinced it would be top 10. Those colours and that sky are just wonderful.</td>', 'I really hoped this would do much better and was convinced it would be top 10. Those colours and that sky are just wonderful.', '2009-05-13 16:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484661, 788459, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m never disappointed with a 6+ score. Still, I think I can see that it deserved better. You really captured darkness here -- looming darkness. Quite interesting how this was gotten from the original.</td>', 'I''m never disappointed with a 6+ score. Still, I think I can see that it deserved better. You really captured darkness here -- looming darkness. Quite interesting how this was gotten from the original.', '2009-05-13 17:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
