(5484805, 787538, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a place to be on a night like that!   Congratulations on 1st place.  Its just beautiful!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  What a place to be on a night like that!   Congratulations on 1st place.  Its just beautiful! ', '2009-05-13 18:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484842, 787924, 49969, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that so many people hold on to beginner''s guidelines like they were verses from the Bible. A softer focus IMO is perfect for the mood. The theme is very clearly conveyed, and the shot is very original. This deserved a ribbon.</td>', 'It''s a shame that so many people hold on to beginner''s guidelines like they were verses from the Bible. A softer focus IMO is perfect for the mood. The theme is very clearly conveyed, and the shot is very original. This deserved a ribbon.', '2009-05-13 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
