(5485977, 787538, 39057, '<td valign="top">I can see Orion the Hunter from here !<br/> <br/>How did you get so little of a star streaking effect with a 61 second exposure? Does it have something to do with the 16mm lens?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-14 11:41:49.</i></td>', 'I can see Orion the Hunter from here ! How did you get so little of a star streaking effect with a 61 second exposure? Does it have something to do with the 16mm lens?', '2009-05-14 12:39:49.000000', '2009-05-14 12:41:49.000000', 0),
